<title>HUNGARY: Hungary cen.bank cuts base rate to 23.00 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary cen.bank cuts base rate to 23.00 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Thursday it will reduce its base rate to an annual 23.00 percent from the current annual 24.50 percent, effective October 1.</p>
<p>&quot;The moderating inflation enabled (the central bank) to reduce the base rate,&quot; the NBH said in a statement.</p>
</text>
